68b3d0f3f04cce9e8f7ae9889c41a79.avif?t=1681237489\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Main Features For Training:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>includes 15 different test-games<br></li><li>flexible complexity settings<br></li><li>fair assessment of abilities<br></li><li>recording the history of the passages<br></li><li>results chart and statistics</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Main Design Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>select any background from the 48 proposed<br></li><li>select a cool background from the add-on package (DLC \u201cPBT-GOLD\u201d)<br></li><li>upload your own background (DLC \u201cPBT-GOLD\u201d)<br></li><li>customize the interface colors to your liking (DLC \u201cPBT-GOLD\u201d)<br></li><li>select a beautiful cursor and color it (DLC \u201cPBT-GOLD\u201d)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070300/extras/251b1f34a3859db678ac57ddf1a1dd3d.poster.avif?t=1681237489\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070300/extras/251b1f34a3859db678ac57ddf1a1dd3d.webm?t=1681237489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The game is developing and will soon be:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>local multiplayer<br></li><li>online multiplayer<br></li><li>battles with friends<br></li><li>more chapters and mini-games<br></li><li>more statistics and cool analysis<br></li><li>builders of own games<br></li><li>and much, much more</li></ul><br>Have you not purchased the Power Brain Trainer yet? What are you waiting for? Let's start brain training!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070300/extras/de629aa3c192052b1e43b45a05f05682.poster.avif?t=1681237489\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor